  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Workshop Series - Regulatory Convergence for Healthcare Products Workshop, through The Webster Group</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USTDA is supporting the Regulatory Convergence for Healthcare Products Workshop to support regional alignment with international standards and convergence of regulatory healthcare systems in Americas Partnership for Economic Prosperity countries in the Latin America and Caribbean region. In turn, this would help to both increase market access for the sales of U.S. healthcare products and improve pharmaceutical and medical device quality and access in Americas Partnership countries.</narrative>
  </description>
